    "content": "## Feedback Intake (A60) · UNPUBLISHED until Akhil says go\nThree intakes, one save sub-flow. No scraping: only people who write to us (Form, our Telegram bot, WhatsApp replies to our number).\nBefore go: connect the Google Sheets Trigger credential + pick the form sheet; Telegram bot can have only one webhook (check no other published flow uses this bot); WhatsApp needs Meta app, GET verify token step and X-Hub-Signature-256 check.",
    "color": 3,
    "width": 384,
    "height": 608
   }
  }
